[center][size=4][b]Fallout 4's body physics lets things pass through each other and snap back. The Anatomy Engine fixes that, and it is what makes [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109435]Anatomy[/url] work: the genitals open and move when bodies touch, the mouth fits what is at the lips, and the penis finds the right opening. It is a drop-in replacement for OCBPC's cbp.dll.[/b][/size][/center]

